ANCHOR. In the improper limit lambda0 = a0 = b0 = 0, mu_N = xbar
exactly and the fixed point solves t = (N+1)/(S + 1/t) with
S = sum (x_n - xbar)^2, giving t = N/S, the maximum likelihood
precision.
